Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:25.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.10,0:00:58.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《格兰其庄园》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.58,0:02:19.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}起来 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come,Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:21.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.66,0:02:24.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事情十分急迫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The game is afoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}穿好衣服赶快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your clothes and come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:44.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I think we have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:46.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经很默契了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thawed sufficiently Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.70,0:02:48.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Splendid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.61,0:02:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯特 玛尔舍姆 格兰其庄园 下午3:30\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abbey Grange,Marsham,Kent,3:30 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.59,0:02:55.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Dear Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.47,0:02:57.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望你能够立刻协助我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be very glad of your immediate assistance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.35,0:03:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解决这桩极特殊的案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in what promises to be a most remarkable case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:03.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}处理这一类案件正是你的特长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something quite in your line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除去已把那位女士放开之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except for releasing the lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.77,0:03:06.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现场一切东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will see that everything is kept{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.55,0:03:08.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都未移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}exactly as I have found it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我请求你火速赶来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I beg you not to lose an instant,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:14.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为单独留下优斯塔斯爵士是不妥当的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as it is difficult to leave Sir Eustace there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的忠实朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yours faithfully.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:18.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯坦莱·霍普金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stanley Hopkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:20.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}霍普金巡关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector Hopkins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他找我到现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's called you in seven times,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}曾有七次 每次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on each occasion his summons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:25.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实都急需我的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been entirely justified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你一定已经把他的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fancy that every one of his cases{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.61,0:03:30.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全收到你的文集里去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has found its way into your collection,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.96,0:03:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I must admit,Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.35,0:03:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你很会选材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you do have some power of selection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.65,0:03:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:38.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这弥补了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which atones for much of which I deplore{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:41.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叙述上的缺陷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about your narratives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:43.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看待一切问题总是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fatal habit of looking at everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.07,0:03:44.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从写故事的角度出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the point of view of a story{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.81,0:03:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是从科学破案的角度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of as a scientific exercise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.38,0:03:49.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样就毁坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has ruined what might have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些典型案例的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an instructive and even classical{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.25,0:03:53.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}示范性和教益性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}series of demonstrations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你为什么不自己写呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you not write them yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.99,0:03:58.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会写的 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will,my dear Watson,I will,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.02,0:04:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会在我晚年的时候写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in my declining years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.61,0:04:04.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在要侦查的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So our present research{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:05.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像是一件谋杀案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}appears to be one of murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.74,0:04:07.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:09.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信上有E B两个字母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'E. B.' monogram,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:12.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}组成的图案做为家徽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coat-of-arms,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.63,0:04:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个地址曾经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with an address which harks back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是修道院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the dissolution of the monasteries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们生活在上流社会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're moving in high-life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.43,0:04:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱肯斯特尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brackenstall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.14,0:04:25.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}优斯塔斯·布莱肯斯特尔爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Eustace Brackenstall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.31,0:04:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你听说过他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've heard of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.87,0:04:28.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是有史以来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was quoted in The Chronicle the other day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.55,0:04:30.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯特郡最大的富翁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as being one of the richest men in Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:32.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你真是知识渊博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson,you are a treasury of knowledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:35.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么说你认为他已经死了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you think him dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.44,0:04:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为他被谋杀了 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think him murdered,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.31,0:04:42.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}霍普金并不是易动感情的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopkins is not an emotional man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.86,0:04:44.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的信说明他心情相当激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The writing shows a certain agitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事情一定很紧急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is surely urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:48.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为尸体是否还留在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think the body left there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:51.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等着我们去验尸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for our own inspection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.21,0:04:53.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们会发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that we shall find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:57.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱肯斯特尔家的人已经所剩无几了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Brackenstall line is now extinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.95,0:05:35.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们能来我真高兴 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good of you to come,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:36.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也是 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you,Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.61,0:05:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.70,0:05:42.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望你能原谅我 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you forgive me,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.11,0:05:43.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原谅你什么 霍普金？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive what,Hopkins?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:45.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不是事情紧急 也不会来麻烦你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should not have troubled you sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.84,0:05:47.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在那位女士已经苏醒过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But since the lady has come to herself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.68,0:05:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她把事情讲得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she has given me so clear an account of the affair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.77,0:05:51.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我们要做的事不多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that well there's not much left for us to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.07,0:05:53.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还记得路易珊姆那伙强盗吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember the Lewisham gang?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.88,0:05:55.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是那三个姓阮达尔的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ring of three Randalls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:56.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:58.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}父亲和两个儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the father and two sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.30,0:05:59.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是他们干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's their work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:00.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这毫无疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:02.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两周前他们在西顿汉姆做了案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they did a job at Sydenham a fortnight ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.31,0:06:04.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人看到了他们并报了案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did,they were seen and described.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.74,0:06:07.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们真是残忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it's cool and I agree{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么快就又害人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to do another so soon and so near,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.10,0:06:10.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定是他们干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it is they,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:11.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该把他们绞死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a hanging matter this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么优斯塔斯爵士死了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brackenstall is dead,then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.55,0:06:15.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe yes,Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.26,0:06:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在餐厅里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the dining room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:18.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的头部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his head was knocked in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.22,0:06:19.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被通条打破了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with his own poker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:21.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那女士呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.06,0:06:42.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们去过餐厅了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have they been in the dining room yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:46.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet,my lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:51.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的周到安排让我感到欣慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall be glad when you can arrange matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:53.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.05,0:06:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的伤不止一处 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have other injuries,madam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:59.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.31,0:07:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这和夜里的惨案没有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has no connection with this hideous business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.05,0:07:07.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.68,0:07:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把一切关于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it would be best{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:13.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}优斯塔斯爵士的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to inform you of something gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.13,0:07:16.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都告诉你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}regarding Sir Eustace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.40,0:07:18.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们无疑会听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll no doubt hear a rumor of it otherwise{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.32,0:07:19.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他人歪曲事实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from idol tongues{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.92,0:07:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}闲言碎语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who'll distort the truth of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:23.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以这种方式玷污他的人格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would pain me to think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我备受痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of his memory tarnished in that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.77,0:07:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我还是得说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Eustace drank{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.14,0:07:35.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}优斯塔斯爵士嗜酒成癖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:37.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有规律 反复无常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not regularly,inconsistently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:40.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但并不会影响我们的婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in a way to hurt our marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:42.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也没有妨碍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nor did it interfere{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.59,0:07:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他执行公务的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the exercise of his public duties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.91,0:07:49.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尽管如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nevertheless,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:53.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这一恶习仍是家族丑闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the vice was a private shame to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不喜欢他的恶习 对此他十分在意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was very sensible of my dislike of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.86,0:07:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当他酒瘾发作时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he felt the obsession to keenly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.88,0:08:00.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就会完全放纵自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he took himself off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:01.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喝得烂醉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until the poison had exhausted him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:06.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的做法自然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It distressed me of course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:08.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我悲痛万分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that it should happen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:11.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但他仍保持着自尊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he was proud and sensitive enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.45,0:08:14.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从不让我看见他烂醉的模样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never to allow me to witness it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.92,0:08:21.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对此 我很感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt deep gratitude for that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.24,0:08:24.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且深表同情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not a little pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:27.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能明白吗 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you understand that gentlemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.30,0:08:29.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未听过有人在谈起这类事情时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never heard a like case talked of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还怀着深切的同情 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with such illuminating compassion madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:36.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想还有件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must,however,ask you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:39.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会让你更惊奇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to believe something further.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:40.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于拥有如此恶习的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in some measure grateful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.91,0:08:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我仍是很感激的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for this vice of my husband's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么会？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could that be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:47.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是在澳大利亚南部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent most of my life in South Australia,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.53,0:08:49.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个靠近阿得雷德的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the wine growing country{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.58,0:08:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}酿酒村庄长大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}near Adelaide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.89,0:08:54.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我很小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a very young woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:56.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就和我父亲生活在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lived alone with my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.23,0:09:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我妈妈已经去世\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:05.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真要说谁给了我母爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had a mother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:08.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是我忠诚的梯芮萨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was my loyal Theresa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.87,0:09:13.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是一段非常自由的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a very free life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.36,0:09:15.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发现我很难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found it extremely difficult{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:17.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在英国适应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to adapt to the proprieties of England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:21.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}庄园夫人这样的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being mistress of such a place as this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:24.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我想 如果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I felt if I would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:25.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于我丈夫的恶习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just show a decent understanding{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.97,0:09:27.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}表达出更大的宽容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of my husband's weakness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.74,0:09:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相反 他也会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he would,in turn,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.03,0:09:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原谅我一些失礼的举动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forgive me for my unsuitable behavior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:36.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而事实也正是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so it proved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.45,0:09:38.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:42.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我来告诉你昨晚的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you about last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.09,0:09:45.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}优斯塔斯爵士大约10点半休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eustace retired about half-past ten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:47.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仆人们都已经回到自己的屋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The servants had already gone to their quarters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.45,0:09:48.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的屋子在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which are where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.60,0:09:49.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在东翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the East Wing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:51.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有我的丈夫 梯芮萨和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only my husband,Theresa and myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.56,0:09:52.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住在正中部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sleep in the central block.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.95,0:09:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他仆人听不到这的响声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The servants would have heard nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那时休息了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had you retired by then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.68,0:09:58.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在自己的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:00.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在夫人未上床休息前我是不会休息的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never retire until I've seen madam to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.54,0:10:02.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.98,0:10:05.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还未睡下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sat up,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.01,0:10:08.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就坐在这屋子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this room in fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有个习惯就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is my custom to walk around{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.65,0:10:42.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}睡前总要检查下房屋是否安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see that the house is secure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.33,0:10:43.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为显而易见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because for obvious reasons,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:45.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}优斯塔斯爵士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir Eustace{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.08,0:10:46.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这方面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is not always to be relied upon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.51,0:10:47.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是靠不住的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in that respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:51.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我先去猎枪室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went into the gun-room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.90,0:10:56.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}厨房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the kitchen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:11:00.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}食起室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the butler's pantry,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:04.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弹子房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the billiard-room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.39,0:11:07.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}客厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the drawing-room,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:11.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后是餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and finally the dining-room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.51,0:11:13.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看到窗帘没拉上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the curtains were drawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.27,0:11:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很难告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's difficult to tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.70,0:11:40.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much of what happened next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.49,0:11:48.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我走到窗前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took a step towards the curtain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.97,0:11:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迎面站着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I found myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.44,0:11:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个闯入者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}face-to-face with an intruder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.56,0:11:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}体型庞大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A big man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}年过半百\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quite elderly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:12:01.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们对视了一会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a moment we just stared at each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:03.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后有两个男人出现在他背后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then two other men came in behind him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个人立即向我扑来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he came for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:07.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一定是昏过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have been unconscious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好几分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for some minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.13,0:12:38.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正在这时我倒霉的丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was then that my unfortunate husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来到餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}entered the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.86,0:12:44.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如你们看到的 他们杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They dealt with him as you shall see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:49.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我又一次昏过去 我也不确定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I fainted again,I'm not sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.39,0:12:52.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}具体的事很难…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The exact events are difficult...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:54.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我时而清醒 时而昏迷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drifted in and out of consciousness,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.51,0:12:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能理解吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.20,0:12:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do know that they{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.77,0:13:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拿走了屋子里的银器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cleared the room of its silver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:03.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们给自己开了瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they must have drawn themselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.08,0:13:04.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}波特酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a bottle of port,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.82,0:13:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看到他们喝酒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of which I saw them drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:08.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}袭击我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man who struck me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:10.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是个留有胡须的中年人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was elderly with a beard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另外两个年轻人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The others younger,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.34,0:13:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}面部很干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}smooth faced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:16.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.94,0:13:19.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们走过来看看是否已把我缚紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally they checked that I was securely bound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:21.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后带着银器离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and left taking the silver with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.67,0:13:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是何时发觉情况不对的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was the alarm raised?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.37,0:13:28.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人一直没有上楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam had not come upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:30.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早前她说过在我之后就会上楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Early she said she would follow me shortly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.52,0:13:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以到了午夜 我就下楼看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so at midnight I went down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:33.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以防她又抱着书睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in case she had fallen asleep over her book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:36.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我讨厌抱着书睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A thing I hate to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.19,0:13:37.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是我就发现了夫人 可怜的人儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there I found her,poor lamb,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:39.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如她说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just as she says{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.47,0:13:40.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}爵士倒在地板上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and him on the floor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:45.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的血和脑浆溅了一屋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his blood and brains all over the room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.25,0:13:47.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些事足以使她吓昏过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough to drive a woman out of her wits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.33,0:13:48.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她被绑在那儿 还被塞住了嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And her gagged and bound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}衣服上还溅上了许多血点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and her very dress spotted with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不是这位澳大利亚阿得雷德港的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She never wanted courage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:14:00.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽·弗莱泽夫人 也就是格兰其庄园的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did Miss Mary Fraser of Adelaide,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱肯斯特尔夫人变得性格坚强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Lady Brackenstall of Abbey Grange{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:05.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那她早就失去生活的勇气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has learned new ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.48,0:14:07.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们询问她的时间已经够长了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've questioned her long enough,gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.84,0:14:09.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位夫人和她的女仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did the lady and the maid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是何时离开澳大利亚的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come from Australia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:12.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大约十八个月前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About eighteen months ago,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.61,0:14:13.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她爸爸送她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her father sent her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.94,0:14:14.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来欧洲体验生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get her experience of Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.98,0:14:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实际是为了找个丈夫吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is to a find a husband?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的女人那时一定以为嫁了个好夫君\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor woman must have seen the bruited match.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.99,0:14:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现场一片狼藉 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a mess sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:22.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Constable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确是一片狼藉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mess indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.93,0:14:39.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们没有碰过任何东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've touched nothing sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.35,0:14:40.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有何看法 医生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you make of it,Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.92,0:14:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以验下尸吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以 我亲爱的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please proceed my dear fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.14,0:14:51.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一击毙命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why it's a blow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:52.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}狠狠地一击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of savage velocity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.83,0:14:54.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一击吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A single blow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:56.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.14,0:15:00.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看 伤口很明显\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a straightforward enough wound,you see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:03.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从耳部开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it begins thus below the ear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.49,0:15:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以这个角度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then crosses both spheres{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伤至顶骨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the parietal bone at such an angle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.59,0:15:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而这一边则被\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That this side is smashed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:14.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}击致颅缝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as far as the cranial suture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未见过这样的伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen anything like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.91,0:15:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个上了年纪的阮达尔 力气一定很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A powerful man,this elder Randall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:26.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他干的一半勾当都和暴力有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half his trade is violence sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:29.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}显然这次他也运用了自己的优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He certainly left his trademark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:30.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我想不通的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What beats me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:34.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然他们知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is how Randall could do so mad a thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.44,0:15:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人能说出他们的外貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knowing that the lady could describe them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.70,0:15:38.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且我们也能认出他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that we could not fail{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.30,0:15:39.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么他们还会做出这种蠢事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to recognize the description.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.98,0:15:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}犯罪心理是难以捉摸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The criminal mind has its quirks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:43.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许有时会带有良知的顾虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of consciousness scruples.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:44.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从这个角度考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that respect,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}此案与其他案件一样拥有独特奇怪之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is as individual and curious as any other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.85,0:15:51.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位夫人也许看似吝啬 实则十分慷慨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A noted miser,Lady,secretly charitable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.08,0:15:53.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以残暴的阮达尔打消了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so this violent Randall may draw the line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.56,0:15:56.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杀死这位昏迷的夫人的念头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the murder of an unconscious woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.72,0:15:59.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不就是他确信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or he may well believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:00.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位夫人没有看到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that she did not see him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.01,0:16:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这怎么可能呢 先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well how is that sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她说他们俩对视了一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She testifies that they stared at each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.05,0:16:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错 但拿着蜡烛的是她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes but it was she who held the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.00,0:16:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而阮达尔看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What Randall may have seen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.46,0:16:12.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极有可能只是闪烁的烛光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was mostly flickering candle flame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}烛光后的相貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The face behind it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.75,0:16:20.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只是模糊的影子罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a distorted mask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.47,0:16:22.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也许没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He may be not imaginative enough{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.53,0:16:23.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她看到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have thought that she saw{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.02,0:16:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并不比他清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anymore than he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.94,0:16:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以他立马打昏了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knocked her unconscious at the next instance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.03,0:16:29.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样就可以达到他的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thus for his purposes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}彻底解决问题… 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}solving his problem... Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.47,0:16:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能检查下土耳其地毯吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I impose upon you to search the Turkey rug?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:38.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}检查地毯干吗 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What for Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.00,0:16:41.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看看是否有蜡滴 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Candle wax,Watson,candle wax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这条铃绳很有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this bell presents a mystery,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.15,0:16:46.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是吗 巡官？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does it not Inspector?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.47,0:16:47.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.51,0:16:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绳子往下一拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When this was pulled down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.87,0:16:50.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}厨房的铃声应该是很响的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the bell in the kitchen must have rung loudly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:51.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于厨房的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one would hear it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人能听得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the way the kitchen is placed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:54.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个情况强盗怎么会知道的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did the burglar know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.27,0:16:55.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly,Mr. Holmes,exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:57.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个问题 我也反复考虑过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the very question I've put myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:59.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}强盗一定很熟悉这栋房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now either he has known the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.81,0:17:01.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不他准和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or he may have dealings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:02.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某个仆人有勾结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with one of the servants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.01,0:17:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的手下正在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of my men is going over the record of service{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.58,0:17:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警局给仆役长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the station with the butler,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.46,0:17:07.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}录笔录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at this very moment sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:09.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡官 你考虑得很周到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inspector,you seem to have thought of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.66,0:17:10.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:17.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:19.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一小滴蜡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A scattering of wax{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:22.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且有轻微地硫化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a very light scorching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.32,0:17:25.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经清理掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Invisible,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.89,0:17:28.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但仍留有其独特的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but leaving it's characteristic scent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.18,0:17:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人一定是在这昏倒的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lady would have fallen here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而阮达尔迅速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Randall would have snatched up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.30,0:17:35.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接住了烛台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the candelabra immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.34,0:17:38.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想他们在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppose that is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.94,0:17:40.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吃了些小点心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where they took their refreshment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.93,0:17:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 以此缓解紧张的心情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To steady their nerves,yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:43.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是波特酒 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Port wine,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱肯斯特尔夫人有说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Lady Brackenstall say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:46.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们用拔塞钻了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the butler's corkscrew was used?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.57,0:17:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.86,0:17:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这伙强盗开酒瓶的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was senseless at the moment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.22,0:17:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她已经失去了知觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the bottle was opened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.64,0:17:51.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.93,0:17:54.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是用螺旋器开瓶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was opened with a pocket screw,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.72,0:17:56.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很有可能是小刀上带的螺旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}probably contained in a knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:59.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仔细观察软木塞的上部可以看出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you examine the top of the cork you will observe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:01.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}螺旋插了三次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that the screw was driven in three times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.19,0:18:03.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才拔出软木塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the cork was extracted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:06.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其实用拔塞钻卡住瓶塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This long screw would have transfixed it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.59,0:18:09.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一下便能拔出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and drawn it with a single pull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.83,0:18:11.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你抓到这个人的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you catch this fellow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:12.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is likely that you will find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他身上有把多用小刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he has a multiplex knife in his possession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}分析得妙极了 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.71,0:18:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这三个玻璃杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These three glasses{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:23.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实困扰着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do puzzle me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.30,0:18:25.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这我必须承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must confess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.68,0:18:31.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱肯斯特尔夫人确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did Lady Brackenstall say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.28,0:18:34.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看见这三个人喝酒了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that she actually saw the three men drinking?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 这一点她记得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe yes,she was clear about that,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.63,0:18:41.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么 这个情况就说到这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then there is an end of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.65,0:18:44.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有什么可说的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What more is to be said?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巡官 也许像夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps,Inspector,when a man has special powers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:50.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样拥有非凡能力的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and special knowledge,like Sherlock Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:51.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当遇到一个极其简单的问题时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it rather encourages him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}追求复杂的答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to seek a complex explanation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才能让他欢欣鼓舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when a simpler one is at hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:58.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一抓到阮达尔就通知我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let us know when Randall is arrested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:29.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可怜的福尔摩斯 你现在一定很郁闷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor Holmes,you must feel like an abstruse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.43,0:19:30.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个有学识的专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A learned specialist{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.72,0:19:34.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却被邀请去解决一个豆大点的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}calling for a case of measles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.09,0:19:36.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很烦人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Annoying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须得回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:10.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那三个玻璃杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three glasses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:24.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:27.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人的美貌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have been dazzled out of observation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.09,0:20:29.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}影响了我们的判断力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by that lady's beauty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.21,0:20:30.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她美是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beauty may be truth{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.54,0:20:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但她没有必要说那件事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but she does not necessarily speak it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.71,0:20:36.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}三个杯子全沾了酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was port in each glass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:39.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是只有一个杯子里有渣滓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there was only crusting in one glass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倒酒时最后一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last glass filled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:43.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很可能是有渣滓的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the one most likely to contain the crusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.39,0:20:44.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.12,0:20:45.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但前提是倒最后一杯酒时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the last pouring it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:46.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瓶中已所剩无几\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had approached the bottom of the bottle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.69,0:20:48.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但瓶子中仍还有半瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the bottle was half full{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而如果倒之前摇晃过的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it had been agitated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.59,0:20:53.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那三杯中都应有渣滓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crusting was present throughout the port.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:55.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那你是怎么想的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well what then do you suppose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.37,0:20:57.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其实只用了两个杯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That only two glasses were used{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两个杯子的渣滓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the drinks of both{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.95,0:20:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都倒在第三个杯子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were poured into a third{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:01.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以产生了假象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to give us the false impression{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.63,0:21:04.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像有三个人在那儿喝酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that three people were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.10,0:21:05.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.{\r}
