Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.63,0:27:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果您愿意把我当做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you will trust me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.34,0:27:07.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朋友一样地信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and treat me as a friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.83,0:27:11.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您会发现我不会辜负您的诚意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you may find that I will justify that trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.11,0:27:12.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要我做什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.50,0:27:13.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我真实的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To tell me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.82,0:27:14.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.00,0:27:17.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不不不不 布莱肯斯特尔夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,no,no please,Lady Brackenstall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.51,0:27:20.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}掩盖是没有用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is of no use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.75,0:27:22.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也许听过我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may have heard of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.21,0:27:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所享有的小名声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little reputation that I may possess,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.61,0:27:25.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我用我的名誉担保\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will stake it all on the fact{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.17,0:27:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你所讲的完全是编造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that your story is a complete fabrication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.16,0:27:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是个无耻的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an impudent fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.86,0:27:32.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是不是说我的女主人撒谎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You try to say that my mistress has told a lie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.62,0:27:34.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有什么要和我说的了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you nothing to tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.43,0:27:36.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我全说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have told you everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.05,0:27:39.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱肯斯特尔夫人 再想一想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now think just once more,Lady Brackenstall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.62,0:27:43.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坦率一些不是更好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't it be better to be frank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.70,0:27:47.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道的都说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have told you all I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.32,0:27:53.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.00,0:28:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}铃绳给了我们提示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bell rope gave us the clue,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.63,0:28:07.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的推论绝对没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which should have left us in no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.17,0:28:08.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到底怎么一回事呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.38,0:28:09.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 如果你想把铃绳拉下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were to pull down a bell rope,Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.92,0:28:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为绳子应当从哪儿断呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where would you expect it to break?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.62,0:28:13.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然是在最上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely at the top{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.09,0:28:14.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}与铁丝相接的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where it is attached to the wire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.79,0:28:16.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是离铁丝三英寸的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not three inches from the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.50,0:28:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是绳子是磨损的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the rope was frayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.75,0:28:20.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个绑住夫人的绳子是被磨损的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rope,which held Lady Brackenstall,was frayed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.19,0:28:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这人很狡猾 用刀子故意磨损绳子的一头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was cunning enough to do that with his knife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.24,0:28:24.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是另外一头没有磨损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the other end was not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.16,0:28:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你像我一样从壁炉架上看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you would have stood on the mantelpiece as I did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:29.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会看到另一头切得很平 没有磨损痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you would have seen that it was cut through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.10,0:28:30.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.21,0:28:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.23,0:28:48.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.93,0:28:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个圆木从今天早上就没有移动过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That log has not moved since early this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.55,0:28:55.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有东西阻碍了它移动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well perhaps it's snagged on something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.41,0:29:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抑或是它被固定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or anchored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.06,0:29:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保证霍普金会在他回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See that Inspector Hopkins{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.70,0:29:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的路上拿到这个 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gets this on his return,will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.82,0:29:16.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chilehurst station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.01,0:29:25.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在要去哪 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where to now Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.68,0:29:28.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跨南航线的海运公司的办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shipping office of the Southern Cross Line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.43,0:29:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对 当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,yes of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.68,0:29:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跨南航线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Southern Cross Line{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.97,0:29:35.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}主要承运从阿得雷德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the principal passenger carrier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.40,0:29:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到伦敦的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}between Adelaide and London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.11,0:29:41.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 我懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.12,0:29:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那年五月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In May of that year,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.72,0:29:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一条航船到了英国港口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only one of ours reached the home port,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.09,0:29:59.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这条船叫"直布罗陀磐石"号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our flagship the Rock of Gibraltar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.74,0:30:02.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会把乘客名单给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have the passenger list sent up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.45,0:30:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生究竟是怎么知道的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How on earth did Mr. Holmes know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.51,0:30:20.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦  找到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe,here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.05,0:30:24.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}阿得雷德的玛丽·弗莱泽夫人 头等舱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Mary Fraser of Adelaide,first class,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.95,0:30:26.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她的女仆在旁陪同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}accompanied by her maid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.58,0:30:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直布罗陀磐石号现在在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the Rock of Gibraltar now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.88,0:30:30.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我去查查就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll know today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.34,0:30:31.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生 她现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was steaming west{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.84,0:30:34.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正向西通过阿拉伯海湾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through the Arabian Gulf,Mr. Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.38,0:30:37.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}前往苏伊士运河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}heading for Suez,I hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.68,0:30:42.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们的政策是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it your policy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.08,0:30:45.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}经常调整船与船之间的人手的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to transfer officers much between ship and ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.80,0:30:47.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是 恰恰相反\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.37,0:30:50.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的政策是尽量不要这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is our policy not to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.44,0:30:53.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 我明白你的意思了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe,I have you,Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.02,0:30:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想问我在这艘船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are asking the whereabouts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.76,0:30:57.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}工作的某个船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a member of the crew of the Rock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.54,0:30:59.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}常常在这艘船上工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has been seen very recently{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.80,0:31:01.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是此次却不在船上的船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not on the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.40,0:31:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生 你的理解能力真让我惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Viviali,your precocity astonishes me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.09,0:31:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要告诉你 我是看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you it is only through study of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.95,0:31:10.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您这位好医生所描写您工作的精彩故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the good doctor's masterly exposition of your work{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.63,0:31:13.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才学会了您推理能力的一点皮毛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I now have any small capacity to reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.97,0:31:15.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.37,0:31:17.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真让我惊奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You amaze me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.66,0:31:20.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你不做笔记吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson are you taking notes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.89,0:31:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有 您会非常高兴地听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also,you will be pleased to hear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.30,0:31:30.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道您要找的人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I know exactly who the officer is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.07,0:31:36.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe,excellent,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.57,0:31:38.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布贝吉太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Burbage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.31,0:31:40.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}excellent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.40,0:31:42.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 各位先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.11,0:31:44.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在唯一是这艘船的船员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only officer from that voyage of the Rock{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.34,0:31:46.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却不在这艘船上的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who is not aboard her now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.39,0:31:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是杰克·克洛克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is Jack Croker,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.13,0:31:49.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一位出色的小伙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a magnificent chap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.73,0:31:52.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道我说得不对吗 布贝吉太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I not correct Mrs. Burbage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.58,0:32:00.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克洛克有个缺点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Croker has a defect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.25,0:32:01.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个讨人喜的同事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A delightful fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.33,0:32:02.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}帅气得就像一个王子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Handsome as a prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.76,0:32:05.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}船员崇拜他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The crew worship him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.30,0:32:07.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们也将他提升为我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we've promoted him to captain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.25,0:32:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}新船"巴斯磐石"号的船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of our new vessel the Bass Rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.13,0:32:10.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用给我沏茶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No tea for me please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.80,0:32:13.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是艘刚刚装修好的新船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is just fitting out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.44,0:32:15.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是我们最年轻的船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the youngest captain we have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.47,0:32:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是将会是最好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he'll be the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.08,0:32:22.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有任何一个船长可以比得上他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not an officer in the fleet to touch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.24,0:32:27.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他性情急噪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is hot headed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.89,0:32:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}容易激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and excitable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.57,0:32:30.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but loyal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.75,0:32:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诚实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}honest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.14,0:32:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而且是个热心肠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and kind-hearted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.79,0:32:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些时候在你的生命里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes in this life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.81,0:32:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你遇到了那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you meet people who are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.62,0:32:42.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也许会叫做 拥有大智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you might call,large-souled,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.45,0:32:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来自上天恩典的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who are a privilege to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.72,0:32:47.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克洛克就是这样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Croker is one of those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.82,0:33:01.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在我的工作中曾经有一两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once or twice in my career{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.74,0:33:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于我查出罪犯而造成的害处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel I've done more real harm{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.62,0:33:05.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要比犯罪事件本身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about my discovery of the criminal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.43,0:33:08.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所造成的害处更大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than ever he had done by his crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.61,0:33:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我现在已经懂得需要谨慎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I've learned caution now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.78,0:33:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我最好是哄骗一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'd rather play tricks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.14,0:33:17.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英国的法律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the law of England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.74,0:33:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是我的良心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than with my own conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.06,0:33:39.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}船长克洛克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Croker,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.23,0:33:41.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.60,0:33:42.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我收到了你的电报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got your telegram,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:45.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且按照你的要求准时来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've come at the hour you said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.15,0:33:47.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说你去过办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you've been down to the office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.90,0:33:51.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是无法从你手里逃脱了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no getting away from you is there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.49,0:33:52.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大声说出来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak up,man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.84,0:33:54.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能站在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't stand there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.27,0:33:55.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和我玩猫捉老鼠的把戏啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and play cat and mouse with me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.84,0:33:57.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底知道什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.23,0:33:58.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 能给他一支雪茄吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you give him a cigar,Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.90,0:34:00.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.13,0:34:07.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克洛克船长 抽抽烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bite on that,Captain Croker,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.33,0:34:12.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要控制住自己的感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and try not to let your nerves run away with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.10,0:34:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我把你当成罪犯 我就不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall not sit here smoking with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.47,0:34:17.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坐在这儿和你一起抽烟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I thought you were a common criminal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.43,0:34:23.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.73,0:34:26.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是用什么来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what did you use{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.76,0:34:29.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让银器被固定在漂浮的圆木上的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to secure the silver to the floating log?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.55,0:34:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜想是用猎枪室的鱼线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My guess it's was fishing gut from the gun-room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.05,0:34:34.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是银器被取出来时我不在现场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was not present at its recovery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.42,0:34:36.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说的对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.26,0:34:37.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想要得到什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.62,0:34:40.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.83,0:34:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For whom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.15,0:34:43.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.92,0:34:47.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们只是想看到正义得以伸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just want to see justice done that is all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.35,0:34:54.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.09,0:34:55.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是鱼线吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it fishing gut?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.76,0:34:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 是麻线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,twine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.00,0:35:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是一个年轻水手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a throw back to the days{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.81,0:35:02.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须要掌握的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the master as a youngster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.66,0:35:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至现在我都会随身带着一枚银币\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even now I always carry a silver coin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.20,0:35:06.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和长麻线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and length twine...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.59,0:35:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一把多用小刀？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a multiplex knife?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.08,0:35:16.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底是怎么知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How in the devil do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.44,0:35:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你到底是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.02,0:35:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.69,0:35:32.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我老老实实地讲讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give me a true account of everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.67,0:35:34.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨晚在格兰其庄园发生的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that happened at the Abbey Grange last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.38,0:35:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对我坦白 我们还可以好好谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be frank with me and we may do some good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.50,0:35:38.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我耍花招的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Play tricks with me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.91,0:35:41.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就毁了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll crush you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.44,0:35:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我就豁出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll chance it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.50,0:35:58.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是有一点我要先说清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But one thing I'll say first,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.79,0:35:59.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我毫不后悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I regret nothing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.93,0:36:01.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear nothing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.26,0:36:02.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果再遇到一次 我还会这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'd do it all again if I had to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.48,0:36:04.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且以此自豪 那个该死的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and be proud of the job,damn the man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.71,0:36:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但只有我 是我一个人干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that's my side of things,only my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.26,0:36:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我想到玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I think of Mary,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.89,0:36:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲爱的玛丽·弗莱泽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sweet Mary Fraser,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.50,0:36:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一想到我使她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think of getting her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.03,0:36:14.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}陷入了困境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into this bloody business,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.49,0:36:15.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就心神不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's that,that turns my soul to water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.15,0:36:23.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是在上一艘船上见到她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I met her when I was first officer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.96,0:36:26.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时候我是大副\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on my last ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.32,0:36:52.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.76,0:36:56.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 我得休息一下 克洛克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh I need air,Mr. Croker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.24,0:36:58.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从来没有这么跳过舞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never danced so much in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.03,0:37:01.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你天生就是个舞者 弗莱泽小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dance if you were born to Miss Fraser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.43,0:37:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保证 这既不是天生的也不是后天培养\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither born nor bred,I assure Mr. Croker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.87,0:37:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想是因为我有个更会跳舞的舞伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Led to it,I think,by a better dancer than I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.46,0:37:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她对待我就和\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She treated me as fairly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.41,0:37:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一般的女人对男人那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as ever a woman treated a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.50,0:37:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们从来没有订过婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were never engaged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.10,0:37:16.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并没有怨言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no complaints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.49,0:37:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是一厢情愿地爱着她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it was all love on my side{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.08,0:37:26.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她只是把我当朋友看待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all-good comradeship and friendship on hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.67,0:37:28.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我们分开的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we parted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.38,0:37:30.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她仍无所牵挂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she was a free woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.16,0:37:37.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我却再也不是个了无牵挂的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I could never again be a free man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.75,0:37:50.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我再次航海归来的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time I came back from the sea{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.73,0:37:54.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说她结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I read of her marriage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.07,0:37:56.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这似乎是她本应就该得到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seemed to be the sort of thing she was made for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.65,0:37:58.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并不悲伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't grieve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.29,0:38:00.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}相反我觉得很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt it to be right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.61,0:38:09.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没想到还会再遇到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I never thought to see her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.66,0:38:13.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上次航行以后我被提升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last voyage I was promoted,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.47,0:38:15.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而新船还没下海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the new boat was not yet launched,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.28,0:38:16.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我要和我的水手们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I had to wait for a couple of months{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.92,0:38:19.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在肯特等两个月\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with my people in Kent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.84,0:38:24.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道她在那 可是我没有去见她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew now where she was but stayed away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.93,0:38:28.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一天我遇到了梯芮萨·瑞特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I met Theresa Wright one day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.41,0:38:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她告诉了我关于她的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she told me all about her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.09,0:38:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}包括那段婚姻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the marriage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.87,0:38:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她残酷的醉鬼丈夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the man's drunken cruelty,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.82,0:38:37.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及所有的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.65,0:38:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们知道那位崇高的男爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know this noble baron{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.36,0:38:42.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}烧掉了她的宠物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had burnt her pet dog{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.96,0:38:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还威胁她吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and threatened as much to her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.56,0:38:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 我告诉你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you gentlemen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.48,0:38:54.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这简直要让我气疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it nearly drove me mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.56,0:38:57.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确实见到了玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did meet Mary{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.83,0:39:01.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后我又见了她一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I met her again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.17,0:39:04.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.17,0:39:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她不想再见我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she would meet me no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.74,0:39:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接着我接到通知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was then given notice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.48,0:39:14.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要在一周内出海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I would leave of my voyage within the week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.20,0:40:00.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.13,0:40:03.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么能来这呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could you come here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.69,0:40:10.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我马上就要离开了 玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm to go away Mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.24,0:40:14.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们给了我艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been given a ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.84,0:40:19.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我马上就走了 我想向你道别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To go and not say farewell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.54,0:40:21.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也许再也没法见到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I might never see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.98,0:40:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要走了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.56,0:40:29.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一点也不为此开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not relish it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.48,0:40:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会是个好船长的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll make a fine captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.89,0:40:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你千万不要错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must not let anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.57,0:40:38.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个大好机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}spoil such an opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.87,0:40:47.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对你是有感情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.64,0:40:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可你无能为力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.23,0:40:54.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是最让我伤心的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,it is which hurts most stunning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.30,0:40:59.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我觉得我这几周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe I should have gone mad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.83,0:41:01.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都快要疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these past few weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.57,0:41:06.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lf... Mary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.58,0:41:09.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我没有这么想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it had not been for the thought of you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.36,0:41:15.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.11,0:41:17.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.79,0:41:19.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是朋友就好 玛丽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friend will do,Mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.06,0:41:21.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我对你的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the measure of my love for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.73,0:41:25.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它如此强烈 将永存于我的心中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's so strong it will live on crumbs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.24,0:41:26.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朋友就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friend will do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.85,0:41:29.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克 你别这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack don't even say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.60,0:41:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这并不会让我们更开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't make us any happier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.47,0:41:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我的感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I feel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.57,0:41:39.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.21,0:41:46.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.38,0:41:50.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那么我要比我来的时候更喜悦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I shall go a happier man than when I came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.78,0:41:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你 亲爱的玛丽·弗莱泽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God Bless you sweet Mary Fraser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.84,0:41:57.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这对我来说已经足够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.86,0:42:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须走了 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must not stay Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.15,0:42:37.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在我的份上 把这个带走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take this for my sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.09,0:42:56.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我终于抓住你们了 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last I have you madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.65,0:42:59.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是你见不得人的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At your taint.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.99,0:43:06.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是你该死的端庄的真面目吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's a key to your damn modesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.57,0:43:09.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还有什么想说的吗 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a confession madam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.18,0:43:11.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个该死的妓女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A damn whore,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.31,0:43:13.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个贫穷的贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gutter queen,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.29,0:43:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个肮脏的荡妇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A filthy jade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.49,0:43:24.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.68,0:43:25.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.96,0:43:27.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}站在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand you there,sir,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.08,0:43:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要管那个该死的妓女了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over the body of your bloody harlot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.88,0:44:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.87,0:44:43.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.79,0:44:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.39,0:45:04.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. My captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.57,0:45:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把这个喝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now drink this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.53,0:45:16.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh... oh what happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.31,0:45:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.39,0:45:23.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you certain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.24,0:45:24.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.49,0:45:25.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我早就想到会有今天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.95,0:45:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh dear God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.74,0:45:31.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们该怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.76,0:45:37.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听老梯芮萨的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to your old Theresa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.48,0:45:39.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你被打了一拳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're marked with a blow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.36,0:45:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这差点要了你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that could have killed you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.86,0:45:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这也许是你解脱的机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that shall be your salvation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.48,0:45:53.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梯芮萨异常的冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theresa was as cool as ice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.32,0:45:56.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是她和我的密谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was her plot as much as mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.88,0:45:58.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须让一切看起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must make it appear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.23,0:46:00.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像是强盗做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the burglars had done the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.70,0:46:02.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}梯芮萨一再给她的女主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Theresa kept on repeating{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.01,0:46:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}重复我们编造的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our story to her mistress,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.14,0:46:04.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我爬上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while I swarmed up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.60,0:46:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}切断铃绳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and cut the rope of the bell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.02,0:46:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后我把玛丽绑在椅子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I then lashed for her in her chair,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.72,0:46:11.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把绳子的末端弄成磨损的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}frayed out the end of the rope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.18,0:46:12.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来让一切看起来自然些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make it look natural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.82,0:46:14.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}银器的事你们都知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The silver well you know about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.21,0:46:15.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 那三个装着酒的杯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do,and the third glass of port{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.02,0:46:17.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是为了嫁祸给阮达尔吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to tie in with the Randalls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.59,0:46:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.92,0:46:20.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后我们把烛台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we dropped the candlestick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.31,0:46:21.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}扔在玛丽摔倒的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by where Mary fell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.67,0:46:23.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样蜡就会溅到她身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the wax would splash on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.62,0:46:24.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以为警察永远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought the police{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.94,0:46:27.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会识破我们的计谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could have seen through our dodge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.27,0:46:29.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我知道那个野蛮人已经死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I knew that savage fiend was dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.47,0:46:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她也可以自由的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and she was free of him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.93,0:46:32.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就把那晚看作是我生命中最美的一晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I reckon I done the best nights work of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.63,0:46:35.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使我被绞死我也会做这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still do even if I swing for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.60,0:46:46.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.05,0:46:49.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全部的事实 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole truth,sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.54,0:46:53.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dear God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.79,0:46:57.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.91,0:47:01.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 你告诉了我们一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes you have told me the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.19,0:47:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果那个女仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if the lady's maid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.33,0:47:03.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能够不要那么节约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had been less abstemious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.38,0:47:05.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}处理了那几个杯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and accepted your glass of port,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.50,0:47:08.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许你就可以骗过我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your ingenuity might have fooled me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.74,0:47:12.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像你已经骗过了警察那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you have certainly fooled the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.05,0:47:17.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁把你的方向引向我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who put you onto me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.48,0:47:19.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你如何找到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How on earth did you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.75,0:47:21.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有杂技演员或水手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one could have gone after that bell rope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.45,0:47:23.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才能够到铃绳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but an acrobat or sailor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.65,0:47:24.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有水手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one but a sailor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.97,0:47:26.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会打那把椅子上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}could have made the knots{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.40,0:47:28.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那种方式的绳结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with which the cord was fastened to the chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.38,0:47:30.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那位夫人在那种情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was evident that the lady was shielding someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.51,0:47:32.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}依旧在庇护别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to do so under such circumstances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.28,0:47:36.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说明她爱那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}meant that she must love the person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.38,0:47:42.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把她和她来这国家时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that too wild a leap of the imagination{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.13,0:47:44.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所乘坐的船上的船员联系起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to connect her with an officer of a ship,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.50,0:47:45.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也并不是太难 不是么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which brought her to this country?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.52,0:47:51.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克洛克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Croker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.83,0:47:57.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你在等一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're expecting a visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.32,0:47:59.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.44,0:48:34.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这位先生知道所有的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dearest the gentleman that knows everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.23,0:48:36.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以不必对他有所隐瞒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no hiding from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.08,0:48:38.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I Know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.99,0:48:41.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的电报让我来这的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His telegram brought me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.42,0:48:46.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有什么打算 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you intend,Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.62,0:48:48.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克洛克船长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well Captain Croker{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.81,0:48:50.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个非常严重的事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is a very serious matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.90,0:48:53.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然我非常确定基于你今晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet I feel sure that on the basis of the story,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.65,0:48:56.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which you have told us here tonight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.33,0:48:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大英帝国的法庭会理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a British court of law will understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.84,0:49:01.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的行为是出于自卫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you acted in defense of your own life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.52,0:49:03.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That,however,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.72,0:49:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}必须要由陪审团决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is for the jury to decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.46,0:49:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meanwhile,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.52,0:49:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我非常同情你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have so much sympathy for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.85,0:49:12.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此你可以选择在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that if you choose to disappear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.94,0:49:14.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}24小时内消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}within the next 24-hours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.79,0:49:18.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保证没有人会阻拦你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise no one will hinder you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.91,0:49:21.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样就可以没事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it will all come out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.37,0:49:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定不会有什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Certainly it will come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.36,0:49:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这算是什么馊主意啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What sort of proposal is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.21,0:49:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}玛丽必须要承担所有的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mary would be left to face the music.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.06,0:49:29.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}甚至作为共犯被拘禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Held as an accomplice maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.04,0:49:31.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 先生 我不会这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sir,it will not do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.03,0:49:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克 你必须走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack you must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.23,0:49:36.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.97,0:49:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}船长 平静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm yourself Captain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.09,0:49:41.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只是在试探你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was only testing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.53,0:49:44.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 这家伙次次都是说的真话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson,this fellow rings true every time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.01,0:49:47.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要承担\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a great responsibility{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.66,0:49:49.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极大的责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I take upon myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.33,0:49:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我们会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we will do it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.86,0:49:52.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按照法律程序来解决的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in due form of law.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.50,0:49:53.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克洛克 你是犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Croker,you are the prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.00,0:49:55.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.65,0:49:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是一位英国陪审员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a British jury,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.95,0:50:01.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从未见过一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I never met any man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.04,0:50:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比你更合适担任陪审员的人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more eminently fitted to represent one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.39,0:50:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now gentle man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.46,0:50:11.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经听取了证词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have heard the evidence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.09,0:50:13.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为这个犯人有罪还是无罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}do you find the prisoner guilty or not guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.18,0:50:14.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}无罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not guilty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.37,0:50:15.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人民的呼声便是上帝的呼声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vox populi,vox Dei.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.83,0:50:17.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}克洛克船长 你无罪释放了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are acquitted,Captain Croker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.72,0:50:24.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.08,0:50:25.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 先生你不能这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sir it will not do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.54,0:50:26.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}船长？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.58,0:50:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果警察抓了其他可怜的无辜者怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if the police arrest some other poor devil,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.60,0:50:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.03,0:50:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就会运用我全部的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I will use all my powers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.26,0:50:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来劝说他们相信自己抓错了人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to persuade them of their mistake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.66,0:50:38.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他们偶然发现了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they light on you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.84,0:50:40.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是另外一回事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then that is another matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.41,0:50:41.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过 我认为这不太可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However,I think that is unlikely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.05,0:50:44.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一年后你再回到这位夫人身边吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come back to this lady in a year's time,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.01,0:50:47.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但愿你和她的未来都能证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and may her future and yours justify{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.62,0:50:49.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们今晚作出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}us in the judgment that we{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.46,0:50:51.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}判决是正确的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have pronounced this night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.28,0:50:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.41,0:51:07.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夫人 我很好奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Madam,I'm intrigued,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.50,0:51:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于一个可悲的酗酒鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you gave such a compelling account{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.01,0:51:11.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是如何做出如此真实的描述的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the man's sad addiction to drink{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.99,0:51:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为据我们所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yet it is not as we now know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.49,0:51:15.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的丈夫并非如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}portrayed as your husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.23,0:51:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可你的描述又如此的令人信服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it was such a clear description I wondered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.63,0:51:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是我的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.66,0:51:23.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可怜的父亲 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My poor father,Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.34,0:51:26.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他正因为这个赶来英国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's on his way England because of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.51,0:51:28.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正是他的自律\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His self-management was the reason{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.15,0:51:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}才让我并不害怕我丈夫的恶习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't fear the vice of my husband{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.89,0:51:32.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我们结婚前我就知道这个了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because I knew of it before we were married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.78,0:51:34.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我真是个傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How foolish I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.73,0:51:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.99,0:51:38.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我非常确定你故事的真实性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt sure that your story was true to reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.70,0:51:40.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.01,0:51:50.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你似乎并不太赞成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost as though you disapproved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.82,0:51:53.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们今天促成的好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the happiness we have fostered this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.60,0:51:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 我赞成你的决定 我当然是赞成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no,I approve of that,of course I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.06,0:51:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是你让我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm uneasy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.91,0:52:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又做律师又做法官的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you took upon yourself the duties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.06,0:52:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这对我来说可不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of advocate and judge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.33,0:52:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你被条条框框束缚住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are too bound by forms,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.94,0:52:10.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 社会就是条条框框组成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forms are society,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.12,0:52:14.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}人不能没有规矩 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Manners make a man,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.23,0:52:20.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}幸好你是独一无二的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just as well you are unique.{\r}
